{
  "_meta": "G7 fragment (owner: LPMODE7). rules.g7_lastprotocol: Last Protocol mode rules (G7 master scope section 10, 13.3, 13.5, 13.8; brainstorm B6, B7, B10, B11, B16, B17). Every number is PROVISIONAL (set in the plan, untuned). Only read when cfg.mode == last_protocol.",
